    "notes": "Native firmware 0.1.13 \u2014 the delivery unblocker: the OTA and TFT tasks suspend the task-watchdog for their flash/stream sections (esp_task_wdt_deinit) \u2014 the full-partition erase (~15-30s with no runnable task) was being killed by the watchdog's hardware stage-2 reset at 20s, so every OTA into the crash loop died mid-erase and rolled back. The watchdog re-arms fresh on the next boot (the firmware OTA) and explicitly after the TFT stream. Carries 0.1.12's coredump verdict instrument unchanged.",
